# Every text the Markdown family shipped at a managed path, oldest first: "<sha256>  <path>",
# the digest taken over the text with LF line endings. The last line of a path is its current
# text; every earlier line must be in the family's Prior (tools/markdownlint/assets.go
# priorDigests, with the text under tools/markdownlint/testdata/prior).
# TestShippedTextLedger (internal/managedasset/shipped_texts_test.go) enforces both
# directions. After a managed text changes, including a Renovate pin update of the workflow:
#   PRAETOR_UPDATE_SHIPPED_TEXTS=1 go test ./internal/managedasset -run 'TestShippedTextLedger$'
# appends the new digest; then record the outgoing text in priorDigests and testdata/prior.
# Never rewrite or drop a line.

